t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI联合苹果前高管向法院申请永久驳回苹果商业秘密窃取诉讼</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Midjourney发布V8.2图像编辑模型，支持指令微调与画布扩展</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布模型硬件标准MHS，正式进军具身智能与物理AI领域</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里发布全新 Qoder：将 AI 编程 IDE 升级为面向全员的智能体工作台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/09bcf9a64753367ba069c7a1f7b80e38.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">8月27日，阿里正式发布全新 Qoder，将原有的 AI 编程 IDE 升级为以 Coding 为核心底座的智能体工作台。该平台支持用户通过自然语言描述目标，由智能体自主完成计划制定、工具调用、执行及验证。技术层面，Qoder 搭载 Harness 长链路执行底座，实现“读—改—验证—迭代”自主闭环，支持跨文件编辑、自纠错及长期记忆。模型侧内置海内外 SOTA 模型并深度适配 Qwen 系列，通过 Auto 智能路由优化性能。产品提供编程与通用双模式，集成 40+ 连接器、70+ 插件及 20K+ 技能，支持 Browser Use 与 Computer Use 操作。Qoder 旨在将工作范式从“亲自生产”转向“委派与验收”，使非技术人员也能处理数据或构建原型。即日起，国际版 qoder.com 与中国版 q</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元发布开源旗舰模型Hy4preview，总参数770B支持1M上下文</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c7a3045daaa2e5f453c10067fe2c8f77.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元于8月28日正式发布新一代开源旗舰大模型Hy4preview，该模型总参数量为770B，激活参数49B，支持1M上下文长度。目前模型已开源至HuggingFace、Github及Modelscope，并同步上线腾讯云TokenHub与OpenRouter。Hy4preview定位真实生产力场景，在软件工程、办公自动化、游戏开发及科研领域表现突出。在游戏开发中，支持通过MCP接入Unreal5与Unity引擎生成可玩Demo；在科研领域，其配合Hyra模型将三维Blaschke–Lebesgue问题的体积下界提升至0.41104。内部盲测显示，在203个工程任务中，Hy4preview均分2.99，略优于GLM-5.3与Kimi K3。腾讯官方表示，Hy4preview为Hy4系列的早期版本，目前仍存在复</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI联合苹果前高管向法院申请永久驳回苹果商业秘密窃取诉讼</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cf14f2030f6c7ab1f5117bbe659e7142.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI携手苹果前高管唐坦、刘畅及io Products向法院提交请愿书，请求“带偏见地驳回”苹果发起的商业秘密窃取诉讼，旨在彻底阻止苹果未来就相同事由再次起诉。此前，苹果指控上述前雇员在跳槽至OpenAI及io Products期间非法获取机密并指导求职者规避安保审查。OpenAI在最新法律回应中指出，苹果的诉状存在根本性事实缺陷，未能根据《保护商业秘密法》（DTSA）清晰界定商业秘密或提供确凿的非法挪用证据，仅依赖模糊描述与主观推测。目前双方诉辩状提交已结束，法院定于10月1日召开动议听证会。此案不仅涉及顶尖人才流动与技术合规边界，其最终裁决也将对硅谷技术人员流动及AI生态中的知识产权保护标准产生深远影响，标志着科技巨头与AI新锐间的法律博弈进一步升级。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Midjourney发布V8.2图像编辑模型，支持指令微调与画布扩展</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ee1ede5743f536d7e046c8acad8c0b4c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Midjourney正式上线V8.2图像编辑模型，标志着其从单一文本生成向精准图像编辑的重大转型。该模型核心支持四大技术特性：一是通过文本指令直接修改现有图像；二是全新的多图参考机制，单次最多支持融合4张图片；三是支持局部重绘（inpainting）与画布扩展（outpainting）；四是全面兼容个性化设置、情绪板及风格参考（srefs）。用户可通过官网主站、alpha.midjourney.com测试网站或Discord频道调用该功能，支持拖拽图片至提示词框或点击“编辑”按钮进行操作。官方表示，V8.2目前处于测试初期，界面将随实验性优化快速迭代。针对复杂边缘情况，官方鼓励用户通过任务ID或表情符号反馈问题，以协助开发团队进行模型调优。此次更新旨在为创作者提供更具可控性的专业级视觉创作工作流。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布模型硬件标准MHS，正式进军具身智能与物理AI领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4c5210c4ae4e9870b5fe8584c0f7bf48.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于8月27日以研究预览形式推出模型硬件标准（MHS），标志着公司正式进军具身智能与物理AI赛道。MHS本质是一套统一的控制与通信标准，旨在为AI智能体提供“翻译层”，使其能够直接操控具备可编程接口的物理设备。通过该标准，AI代理可在无需人工干预的情况下，自主控制显微镜、液体处理器、机械臂及量子计算设备，实现全天候自动化流程。在生物医药、量子计算与先进制造等硬科技领域的早期闭门测试中，MHS表现出显著的提速效应。以制药巨头基因泰克为例，在赋予AI直接操控多台异构实验设备的能力后，全自动剂量反应曲线实验的开发与运行周期缩短至原来的三分之一。此次发布意味着Anthropic将大模型应用边界从数字对话拓展至实体产线，推动AI从感知物理世界向执行复杂动作及持续学习演进。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
